# The OpenCL template's suite on Windows, 2026-11-26.
#
# Until this run the template had no Windows path at all: src/ClRuntime.cpp and
# test/opencl_suite.cpp loaded with dlopen and named libOpenCL.so.1, and
# run-tests.sh printed "NOT RUN: minimal-opencl-ofx (no .bat runner: that suite is
# POSIX-only)". Both now have a _WIN32 branch (LoadLibraryA("OpenCL.dll") +
# GetProcAddress) and the template has build.bat and test/run-tests.bat.
#
# Machine: Windows, MSVC 14.50.35717 (VS 18 BuildTools), driver-provided OpenCL.
# Command: cmd /c templates\minimal-opencl-ofx\test\run-tests.bat

