## 4. what this run does not cover

  [6/6] valgrind memcheck
    skipped: no valgrind on Windows. The POSIX script runs both binaries under
    memcheck; this run does not, and says so instead of implying it did.

- No memcheck on Windows, so definite leaks are not checked here.
- Device throughput is not measured: the suite checks pixels and refusals, not
  speed, and an RTX 3060 through the driver's OpenCL is not a measurement of any
  other device.
- The suite ran with the driver's ICD registered in the system. A machine without
  an ICD is the exit-2 branch ("no OpenCL device on this machine: the suite did
  not run (not a pass)"), which this run did not exercise.

